@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra REST API trang thai dich vu (Mong doi: 200 OK)
GET {{host}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach bai tap (Mong doi: 200 OK)
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tao luot nop hop le (Mong doi: 201 Created + Location header, status = received)
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 4. Doc lai trang thai luot nop: received -> processing -> graded (Mong doi: 200 OK)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Tao luot nop thieu du lieu (Mong doi: 400 Bad Request - INVALID_SUBMISSION)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. Tao luot nop vao bai tap da dong (Mong doi: 400 Bad Request - ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 7. Doc luot nop voi ID khong ton tai (Mong doi: 404 Not Found - SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Bat tay SignalR Negotiate lay connectionId (Mong doi: 200 OK)
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai duong dan Hub (Mong doi: 404 Not Found)
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
